    "text": "Hey guys!\n\nI’ve raised 2 issues and opened 5 PRs in olake-go over the last few days. Here’s a quick overview of what I’ve worked on:\n\n*PRs:*\n• *#1449:* Fixed status code checks and some whitespace handling in telemetry.\n• *#1448:* Improved error handling so the original errors aren’t lost.\n• *#1447:* Added error checks for Oracle schema iteration.\n• *#1445:* Added missing error checks while fetching MySQL table names.\n• *#1444:* Removed an invalid timestamp format entry.\nAlso raised 2 issues:\n\u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-go/issues?q=is%3Aissue+state%3Aopen+author%3Arajarshidattapy\u003e\n\nWould appreciate it if you guys could take a look at the PRs and share your feedback!\n\nPRs: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-go/pulls?q=is%3Apr+state%3Aopen+author%3Arajarshidattapy\u003e",
